<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index-November 14.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index-November 14.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close  was 3110.24,15.82 points or 0.51 percent lower than Wednesday's close.</p>
